{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/648423-demon-the-fallen-question-about-character-creation","id":648423,"title":"Demon: the Fallen - question about character creation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-01T15:46:22-07:00","id":648423,"title":"Demon: the Fallen - question about character creation","content":"Hi there!<br /> <br /> I'm creating a character for a Demon game and I was wondering about something: when deciding on the character's abilities and attributes, should I think of the traits of the demon or just the host?<br /> <br /> In other words: let's say an intelligent demon possesses a host of average intelligence. Would the resulting character have the intelligence of the demon or of the host? Are demons limited by the traits of the host, or can they overwrite them with their own?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1245-varsovian","name":"Varsovian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T17:22:15-07:00","id":648473,"title":"","content":"I would say physical and appearance for the host, rest of social and mental for the demon","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-01T17:53:57-07:00","id":648485,"title":"","content":"I agree with Dwight on the Attributes but it should be noted that they do inherit the memories of the host. So with Abilities I'd say the host, particularly for the more modern Abilities. Yes, the Demons could retain some Abilities, like Occult, but their memories aren't exactly the greatest after eons of imprisonment in the hell that is the Abyss.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T04:33:44-07:00","id":648742,"title":"","content":"I see. That's what I thought, but then the &quot;character creation&quot; notes for Houses seem to suggest that a demon inherits everything from the host. A bit strange...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1245-varsovian","name":"Varsovian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"172"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T06:01:19-07:00","id":648774,"title":"","content":"It inherits all the hosts memories and skills, the demon retains some of its own memories but that's more tied into the background pertaining to it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T06:03:22-07:00","id":648777,"title":"","content":"Think of the demon as a parasite kicking out the soul of the host but then getting access to all the juicy bits trapped in the brain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T06:04:55-07:00","id":648799,"title":"","content":"It really does depend on the demon, and what you want to do with the character. I usually tell my players to build the mortal host first, then make modifications based on what the demon brings to the mix, or what the demon tries to change about the host once it is in control.<br /> <br /> So a mortal host of average intelligence, with no special skills, might gain a dot of Intelligence and one or two dots of Medicine when they get possessed by a brilliant Scourge. Similarly, if the host is not physically fit (such as with Hasmed's host, from the novels), then the period between possession and story-start might be spent trying to get them into shape.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />Avatar commissioned from the incomparable Melissa Uran.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/966-redford_blade","name":"Redford_Blade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar966_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"90"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}